, most of the maps feel to oriented on confined spaces, and Axis Invasion is terrible. You will go from having a nice and balanced game against another player, too being spawnkilled, arriving in games where all NPCs are dead, phones trapped, mines laid everywhere or even some maps obejctive exploited (looking at you vineyard).\r\nSo no, I do not recommend the game, too expensive for just a campaign, the Axis Invasion mode needs severe rebalancing in favour of the invader, but despite that, I still enjoy the series, and for people just wanting to play a ww2 sniper game, wait for a sale, do not play with invaders on, do not play as the invader, and you'll have a fun time. (Co-op makes it even better imo)", "timestamp_created": 1776541736, "timestamp_updated": 1776541736, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223424795", "author": {"steamid": "76561198800322812", "personaname": "Semedeann", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198800322812/", "num_games_owned": 94, "num_reviews": 40, "playtime_forever": 2365, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 468, "last_played": 1786723269, "avatar": "821b4f2af9127609ee7c67d4ec6e5f7ceab631d9"}, "language": "english", "review": "another good sniper game, same as sniper elite 5", "timestamp_created": 1776409317, "timestamp_updated": 1776409317, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}]}